 mira:{birthday:3,likes:['stew','berryPie'],dislikes:['fish'],events:[['The last packet','Mira shows you a packet with a child’s drawing on it. “My sister drew these flowers. Do you think anything can grow here again?”',['We can plant them together.','Keep them safe until you are ready.'],['“Together.” She repeats it like a promise.','“Thank you for not asking me to let go.” She folds the drawing carefully.']],['An empty bowl','Mira has set two bowls on the table. “I caught myself waiting for your footsteps. Is that silly?”',['I look forward to coming back here.','You deserve company, even on quiet days.'],['She smiles and moves your chair closer to the fire.','“Maybe I am finally learning that.” She passes you the warm bowl.']]]},
