 bram:{birthday:12,likes:['grilled','stew'],dislikes:['berries'],events:[['A quiet tunnel','The pump falls silent. Bram pretends not to notice. “I used to like the dark. Before it started feeling empty.”',['I can sit here a while.','Tell me about the old tunnels.'],['You listen to the kettle together until the pump starts again.','He draws an old route in the dust. His voice grows steadier as he talks.']],['A small tapping','Bram places a hand against the stone. “Hear that? I think something is alive on the other side.”',['We will find it when you are ready.','A heartbeat. Just like your pump.'],['“With you along, I think I could go anywhere.”','He laughs softly. “Maybe we are not the only ones still listening.”']]]},
 iona:{birthday:17,likes:['fishSoup','berryPie'],dislikes:['fish'],events:[['The unused bed','Iona smooths the blanket on a bed nobody uses. “I keep making it. Just in case.”',['Leave the lantern on. Someone may come.','You can rest there, too.'],['She turns the wick a little higher.','“I forget that sometimes.” She sits down for the first time all evening.']],['Who heals the healer?','Iona’s hands shake as she sorts the medicine. “I am supposed to be the one who knows what to do.”',['You do not have to carry it alone.','Let me make the tea this time.'],['She takes a long breath. “Would you stay for one cup?”','She hands you the kettle. It feels like a very small, very important trust.']]]},
