 omniFists:{title:'Hands outside the world',color:'#e7bdff',first:'What is this?! Those floating fists are bending the air!',text:'The fists drift around you, impossibly calm after their strike. Your friend takes a step closer, then stops. “Those are not weapons a blacksmith can make. Who are you?”',choices:['I am still your friend.','I am the Admin. I built this place.'],answers:['“Then promise those hands will protect people.” Their breathing steadies.','“Our little fire, these trees… us?” They stare for a moment. “Then please keep making room for us.”'],reward:{stew:1}},
 lineOfCode:{title:'Between the lines',color:'#a1f3d9',first:'What is this? There are words changing the world around you!',text:'A line of code hovers between you. Your friend reaches toward a spinning bracket and it becomes a tiny lantern. “Can you rewrite what we lost?”',choices:['I can help us build something new.','Some things should be remembered, not erased.'],answers:['“Start with a home that nobody has to abandon.” They keep the little lantern.','“Then leave our names in the world.” They trace a glowing letter with one finger.'],reward:{torch:5}},
 waterFists:{title:'A river in your hands',color:'#8bddeb',first:'The water is following your hands! How are you doing that?',text:'A ribbon of water curls into a bowl without spilling. Your friend laughs as a tiny fish-shaped wave circles their boots. “Could you teach me just that part?”',choices:['Try moving with the current.','Let us fill the camp’s water jars.'],answers:['They copy your stance. A single droplet rises, and both of you cheer.','You fill the jars together. For once, nobody needs to make the long trip to the coast.'],reward:{fish:2}},
 flameFists:{title:'A dragon at the hearth',color:'#ffb579',first:'There is a dragon in that fire! Keep it away from the roof!',text:'The dragon-shaped flame lowers its head beside the cold cookfire. Your friend shields their face, then notices its breath warming the kettle. “It listens to you?”',choices:['It knows a hearth from a battlefield.','Let us keep everyone warm tonight.'],answers:['The flame curls small enough to fit beneath the pot. Their fear turns into a smile.','The last ember settles in the cookfire. The camp will have a warm supper tonight.'],reward:{grilled:2}},
 frostFists:{title:'Flowers of ice',color:'#c6eeff',first:'The air turned cold… are those flowers made of ice?',text:'Frost opens into tiny flowers on a broken cup. Your friend holds it up to the light. “I have not seen anything this delicate in a long time.”',choices:['Take one before it melts.','Beautiful things can grow here again.'],answers:['They wrap the cup in cloth, determined to keep it for one more morning.','They study the ice petals. “I think I needed to see that.”'],reward:{nectar:3}},
